  "description": {
    "text": "Shogakukan's children's magazines held a Pokémon Card Game Design Contest for the summer film in 2009 and 2010. Children colored or drew a Pokémon of the film, and each magazine's grand prize winner had their design made into a card for them, 100 copies by the announcements, printed with the film's logo and the words Pokémon Card Game Design Contest: Grand Prize. In 2010 every prize winner of the contest also got a pair of cards of its own.",
